  "body": "Quality is evident throughout, with carefully curated finishes including Hardwood floors, Bremworth Wool carpet, Hansgrohe tapware, Geberit Bathroom ware. A premium kitchen complete with wine fridge, and timeless contemporary detailing that complements the home's sophisticated design.\r\n\r\nThree to four generous bedrooms depending on how you wish to configure your living; two beautifully appointed bathrooms plus a guest powder room. \r\nTwo separate living areas, delivering versatility for busy families, professionals, or those seeking a refined lock-up-and-leave lifestyle.\r\nTwo separate single lock-up garages provide secure parking and exceptional practicality - an increasingly rare luxury in this tightly held location.\r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned across approximately 214m2, and thoughtfully redesigned using an Archimax Aluminium Cladding system - the \"undisputed leader in cladding solutions, combining critical performance attributes with exceptional design versatility\".  Three substantial frameless glass balconies, creating seamless indoor-outdoor living and providing the perfect vantage point to enjoy the ever-changing panorama.\r\n\r\nCommanding an exceptional position above Orakei Domain, this home has been fully renovated to the latest code compliance standards. It captures breathtaking, uninterrupted views stretching across the park to the sparkling Waitemata Harbour.\r\n\r\nPerhaps the icing on the cake… the flat and landscaped garden perfect setting for downsized gardening or a pet's delight.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Auckland's most coveted coastal suburbs, moments from the waterfront walkways, beaches, the city, and excellent schooling. \r\nThis is an outstanding opportunity to secure a home where quality, generous proportions, and an enviable lifestyle come together in perfect harmony.",
